_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "In an election between two candidates A and B, A got 33% of total votes casted and still lost by 55,522 votes. Find the total number of votes got by B.", "options": [{"text": "1,09,114", "added": false}, {"text": "1,09,141", "added": false}, {"text": "1,04,911", "added": false}, {"text": "1,09,411", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "1500", "added": false}, {"text": "500", "added": false}, {"text": "750", "added": false}, {"text": "1000", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "4.425 years", "added": false}, {"text": "2.425 years", "added": false}, {"text": "1.425 years", "added": false}, {"text": "3.425 years", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "If the radii of two circles are 6 cm and 3 cm and the length of the transverse common tangent is 8 cm, then the distance between the two circles is:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Circles-Polygons", "sub": "tangents-and-chords", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 21, "text": "In what ratio must a grocer mix two varieties of pulses costing ₹60 and ₹75 per kg, respectively, so as to get a mixture worth ₹65 per kg?", "options": [{"text": "3 : 4", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 1", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 3", "added": false}, {"text": "1 : 2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mixture-Alligation", "sub": "mixture-price", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 22, "text": "In an isosceles triangle, the angle between equal sides is 40°. The bisectors of the other two angles will intersect each other at an angle of:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Geometry", "sub": "triangles", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 24, "text": "The cost price of an item increased from ₹2,500 to ₹3,000. Find the increase percentage.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 25, "text": "Find the circumference of a circle whose area is 154 m2 .", "options": [{"text": "44 m", "added": false}, {"text": "29.5 m", "added": false}, {"text": "39 m", "added": false}, {"text": "52 m", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "circle-sector-ring", "key_answer": null}]}